| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| `v15.0.0-RC` | `headers` is now an async function. A [codemod](/docs/app/guides/upgrading/codemods#150) is available. |
| `v13.0.0`    | `headers` introduced.                                                                                  |

